# Production Reference: Cross-Cluster LLM Mesh via Kagent on AKS
This document provides a production-grade architecture blueprint and deployment guide for building an **LLM & Agent Mesh** across multiple Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) clusters. It utilizes **Kagent** and **Solo Kgateway** to manage cross-cluster model orchestration, multi-namespace delegation, and secure tool access via the Model Context Protocol (MCP).
